BAZ_PWM is 200, KP is 20 and the error is 3 (left ahead). What does this code print?

```
int hata = 3;
int pwmSol = constrain(200 - 20 * hata, 0, 255);
int pwmSag = constrain(200 + 20 * hata, 0, 255);
Serial.print(pwmSol);
Serial.print(" ");
Serial.println(pwmSag);
```

